2013-12-11T16:50:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9434555172920227,"text_excerpt":"Just finished an absolutely fabulous breakfast here today. I really like this place, I just wish they had opened when I still lived in the neighborhood. The staff was so sweet and the food was very yummy! They started us off with these tiny little complementary biscuits with honey pecan butter and coffee. The waitress even noticed that I was pregnant and asked if I wanted decaf coffee instead of regular. How thoughtful! Then my breakfast buddy and I split the stuffed French Toast (filled with bananas and pancetta) and the brie and blueberry waffles. The breakfasts are served with your choice of house breakfast potatoes, creamy grits or fresh fruit. We both opted for the potatoes which wer..."},{"business_id":"TdyHRkxn334JxtUSdGpIiw","review_id":"haGVrItMyeC2KLaCFKbXqQ","date":"2014-02-09T21:12:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9426293969154358,"text_excerpt":"This place is great, great customer service and the food is delicious. I had the blue berry waffles with Brie out of this world. The other half had biscuits and gravy. Both dishes were delicious, also try the biscuits and spread they give you when you sit down that is also delicious. Loved our brunch there this morning!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TdyHRkxn334JxtUSdGpIiw","photo_id":"k70n6hd85-8vnt0WuLKu6A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/k70n6hd85-8vnt0WuLKu6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8555065989494324},{"business_id":"TdyHRkxn334JxtUSdGpIiw","photo_id":"-124H3p_9ThP3gNIWeCosQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-124H3p_9ThP3gNIWeCosQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.834284782409668},{"business_id":"TdyHRkxn334JxtUSdGpIiw","photo_id":"4BRu8yZRzcixtzsiBGYqfA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/4BRu8yZRzcixtzsiBGYqfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8188974261283875},{"business_id":"TdyHRkxn334JxtUSdGpIiw","photo_id":"9TZyoOgWU2mC7m5UqH-c_A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9TZyoOgWU2mC